  "title": {
   "en": "Mujihina Akuyaku Kizoku ni Tensei shita boku wa Shouaku Mahou o kushi shite Mahou Sekai no Chouten ni tatsu ~Heroine nante inai to Akiramete itara Mukou kara katte ni Yottekimashita~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "無慈悲な悪役貴族に転生した僕は掌握魔法を駆使して魔法世界の頂点に立つ 〜ヒロインなんていないと諦めていたら向こうから勝手に寄ってきました〜"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Reincarnated as a Ruthless Villainous Aristocratic, Using My Domination Magic, I Rose to the Top of the Magical World"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I was reincarnated as the villainous aristocrat, Vanitas, and decided to defy my destined destruction. By using the absolute power of Domination Magic, I will protect the heroines who were originally meant to be taken away, and push forward on my path to the top of the magical world.",
   "ja": "悪役貴族・ヴァニタスに転生した僕は、破滅の運命に抗うことにした。絶対的な支配の力【掌握魔法】を駆使し、本来奪われてしまうはずのヒロインたちを守り、魔法世界の頂点を目指して我が道を突き進む──。"
  },
